-Defaults describe the DeepSeek V4 Flash deployment. Operational detail and measurements live in the private `pcai-llm-serving` repository.
+Defaults are the exact **DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 EAQ v1.1 candidate**: published EXL3 image, verified EAQ model PVC, disk-backed original Engram staging, C1/8K/eager settings and bounded resources. No override file is required. **`replicaCount: 0` is intentional: importing the chart does not start inference.** GPU qualification is required before an attended model boot.

