 | `resources` | CPU, memory and ephemeral storage. GPUs come from `gpu.count`; the schema rejects GPU entries here. |
 | `localModel` | Selected hash-pinned files from a read-only source PVC, staged to disk-backed `/local-model`. Requires ephemeral-storage request/limit and current free-space headroom. |
 | `startupTimeoutSeconds` | Time allowed until `/health` responds (weights, compile, graph capture). |
+| `ezua.virtualService` | PCAI ingress: a VirtualService for `endpoint` on `istioGateway`, routed to the Service with no retries and a long `timeout`. PCAI substitutes `${DOMAIN_NAME}`. The engine API key still applies. |
 | `wireguard` | Userspace WireGuard sidecar (no TUN device, no privileges) plus a wstunnel client to the TLS edge. Needs a peer config Secret and an HTTPS auth-header Secret. |

 An init container checks the model completion record, the read-only mount, the actual `/dev/shm` size and a writable cache directory before the engine starts. It fails fast instead of after a long load.
